  </Items>
  <LayoutTree>
    <LayoutGroup Weight="100">
      <LayoutItem DashboardItem="gridDashboardItem1" Weight="22.730317263055465" />
      <LayoutTabContainer DashboardItem="tabContainerDashboardItem1" Weight="77.269682736944532">
        <LayoutTabPage Orientation="Vertical" DashboardItem="dashboardTabPage1" Weight="100">
          <LayoutItem DashboardItem="chartDashboardItem1" Weight="100" />
        </LayoutTabPage>
        <LayoutTabPage Orientation="Vertical" DashboardItem="dashboardTabPage3" Weight="100">
          <LayoutItem DashboardItem="chartDashboardItem2" Weight="100" />
        </LayoutTabPage>
      </LayoutTabContainer>
    </LayoutGroup>
  </LayoutTree>
  <CustomProperties>
	  <Description>["This dashboard helps illustrate use of Parallel Periods - An indispensable feature designed to help you compare values between different time periods.", "Option 1: With the Measure Filter, you can compare data between predefined DateTime periods. Click a measure in the Designer and add filters to display values for the specified date period. Check the YTD Sales Comparison Chart. Thanks to conditional formatting support within Dashboard Charts, users can easily distinguish leading sales from lagging sales.", "Option 2: If using calculated fields, you can use the joinRule function (in aggregation) to shift the Measure value by the DateTime axis. This feature allows you to compare values between dynamic date periods. We leveraged this capability in our Multi-Year Sales Comparison chart. We also applied a Visible Data Filter to limit displayed data and chose to hide first year of sales information."]</Description>
    <Links>[{"href":"https://docs.devexpress.com/Dashboard/117032/web-dashboard/create-dashboards-on-the-web/data-shaping/filtering", "text":"Measure Filter"}, {"href":"https://docs.devexpress.com/Dashboard/117032/web-dashboard/create-dashboards-on-the-web/data-shaping/filtering", "text":"Visible Data Filter"}, {"href":"https://docs.devexpress.com/Dashboard/402203/web-dashboard/create-dashboards-on-the-web/dashboard-item-settings/chart/conditional-formatting", "text": "Chart Conditional Formatting"}, {"href":"https://docs.devexpress.com/Dashboard/115870/common-features/advanced-analytics/aggregations/intermediate-level-aggregations", "text":"joinRule"}]</Links>
  </CustomProperties>
</Dashboard>